# Nodex Beta Frontend — Environment Variables
# Project: nodex-beta  →  https://nodex-beta.vercel.app
#
# Where to set these:
#   Vercel dashboard → nodex-beta → Settings → Environment Variables
#   Apply to: Production + Preview (and optionally Development)
#
# IMPORTANT: Vite only exposes variables prefixed with VITE_ to the browser bundle.
# Variables without this prefix are invisible to client-side code.
#
# ── REQUIRED ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# URL of the deployed beta coordinator API (nodex-beta-api Vercel project).
# No trailing slash.
# Without this, the frontend defaults to:
#   - http://localhost:3003  (when running on localhost)
#   - window.location.origin (when hosted, only valid if frontend + API share a domain)
# For production: this MUST point to the nodex-beta-api deployment.
VITE_NODEX_BETA_API_URL=https://nodex-beta-api.vercel.app
